    "Application observed on this Mac at capture time; source is not verified.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app was in the foreground when this item was recorded. Its source is unverified."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette app était au premier plan au moment de l’enregistrement. L’origine exacte de l’élément reste inconnue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "捕获时此 Mac 上的前台应用，实际来源未经验证。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese App war beim Erfassen im Vordergrund. Die Herkunft des Eintrags ist nicht bestätigt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’app era in primo piano al momento della registrazione. L’origine dell’elemento non è verificata."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記錄當下在這部 Mac 前景執行的 App，實際來源未經確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to manual and automatic protection. Search terms and enabled app names are visible on screen and in accessibility. Clipboard content stays hidden; automatic protection still blocks hover reveals.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to manual and automatic protection. Search terms and allowed app names appear on screen and are accessible to assistive technologies. Clipboard content stays hidden. Hovering cannot reveal it during automatic protection."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’applique aux protections manuelle et automatique. Les termes recherchés et les noms d’apps autorisés sont visibles à l’écran et accessibles aux technologies d’assistance. Le contenu du presse-papiers reste masqué. Le survol ne le révèle pas en protection automatique."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于手动和自动保护。搜索词与已允许的来源应用名会显示在屏幕上，并可由辅助功能读取。剪贴板内容仍被遮盖；自动保护仍禁止悬停显现。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gilt bei manuellem und automatischem Schutz. Suchbegriffe und freigegebene App-Namen sind auf dem Bildschirm und für Bedienungshilfen sichtbar. Der Inhalt der Zwischenablage bleibt verborgen. Bei automatischem Schutz kann der Zeiger keine Inhalte aufdecken."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vale per la protezione manuale e automatica. I termini cercati e i nomi delle app autorizzate sono visibili sullo schermo e accessibili tramite le tecnologie assistive. Il contenuto degli appunti resta nascosto. Con la protezione automatica il puntatore non può mostrarlo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於手動與自動保護。搜尋字詞與允許顯示的 App 名稱會出現在螢幕上，也能透過輔助使用功能讀取。剪貼板內容仍會隱藏，自動保護也不會因游標停留而顯示內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic detection is limited. Use manual protection before important sharing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic detection covers only some sharing sessions. Turn on manual protection before sharing sensitive content."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La détection automatique est limitée. Activez la protection manuelle avant un partage important."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动检测的覆盖范围有限。重要共享前，请开启手动隐私保护。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die automatische Erkennung ist eingeschränkt. Aktiviere vor wichtigen Bildschirmfreigaben den manuellen Schutz."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il rilevamento automatico è limitato. Attiva la protezione manuale prima di condivisioni importanti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動偵測的覆蓋範圍有限。重要分享前，請開啟手動隱私保護。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic detection is off. Use manual protection before sharing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic detection is off. Use manual protection before sharing."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La détection automatique est désactivée. Activez la protection manuelle avant de partager."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动检测已关闭。共享前请手动开启保护。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die automatische Erkennung ist ausgeschaltet. Aktiviere vor der Bildschirmfreigabe den manuellen Schutz."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il rilevamento automatico è disattivato. Attiva la protezione manuale prima di condividere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動偵測已關閉。分享前請手動開啟保護。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
