    "Checks Zoom and Teams sharing toolbar titles using Accessibility. Client versions and languages may not match. System sharing, remote desktop, recording and browser tabs are not covered. Enable manual protection before important sharing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses Accessibility to check Zoom and Teams sharing toolbars. App versions and languages may affect detection. System sharing, remote desktop, screen recording, and browser tabs are outside its scope. Use manual protection before sharing sensitive content."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilise l’accessibilité pour détecter les barres de partage de Zoom et Teams. La détection dépend de la version et de la langue de l’app. Le partage système, le bureau à distance, l’enregistrement de l’écran et les onglets de navigateur ne sont pas couverts. Activez la protection manuelle avant de partager du contenu sensible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过辅助功能检查 Zoom 和 Teams 的共享工具栏标题。客户端版本和语言可能导致不匹配；不覆盖系统共享、远程桌面、录屏和浏览器标签页。重要共享前请手动开启保护。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutzt die Bedienungshilfen, um Freigabeleisten von Zoom und Teams zu erkennen. Version und Sprache der App können die Erkennung beeinflussen. Systemfreigaben, Fernzugriff, Bildschirmaufnahmen und Browser-Tabs werden nicht erkannt. Aktiviere den manuellen Schutz vor der Freigabe vertraulicher Inhalte."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa Accessibilità per rilevare le barre di condivisione di Zoom e Teams. Il rilevamento può variare in base alla versione e alla lingua dell’app. Sono esclusi la condivisione di sistema, il desktop remoto, le registrazioni dello schermo e i pannelli del browser. Attiva la protezione manuale prima di condividere contenuti sensibili."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過「輔助使用」檢查 Zoom 和 Teams 的分享工具列名稱。辨識結果可能因版本和語言而異。系統分享、遠端桌面、螢幕錄製和瀏覽器分頁均不在偵測範圍內。重要分享前請開啟手動保護。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
