            "value": "Filtra al passaggio del puntatore"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停留時篩選"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the tags above the clipboard cards to filter after opening the clipboard.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the tags above the cards to filter your clipboard history."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez les étiquettes au-dessus des cartes pour filtrer l’historique."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "召唤出剪贴板后，上方的标签可供筛选。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nutze die Tags über den Karten, um den Verlauf zu filtern."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa le etichette sopra le schede per filtrare la cronologia degli appunti."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟剪貼板面板後，可用卡片上方的標籤篩選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· With hover filtering, pause the pointer over a tag to show the matching cards. You can still click tags to combine multiple filters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Hover over a tag to see matching cards. Click tags to combine filters."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Survolez une étiquette pour voir les cartes correspondantes. Cliquez sur plusieurs étiquettes pour combiner les filtres."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· 使用悬浮筛选时，指针悬浮在标签上方片刻时切换至当前筛选下的所有卡片，仍可使用点按手势进行多筛选"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Lass den Zeiger auf einem Tag ruhen, um passende Karten zu sehen. Per Klick kannst du mehrere Filter kombinieren."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Lascia il puntatore su un’etichetta per vedere le schede corrispondenti. Fai clic su più etichette per combinare i filtri."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· 使用停留篩選時，把游標停在標籤上即可顯示符合的卡片。按一下標籤仍可組合多個篩選條件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
