    "Show / hide pinned items": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show or hide pinned items"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示／隐藏置顶项目"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher ou masquer les éléments épinglés"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angeheftete Einträge ein-/ausblenden"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostra o nascondi gli elementi fissati"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示或隱藏置頂項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note stays visible. Copy and paste use the original; previews, editing, dragging and online link previews are blocked while hidden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note stays visible. Copy and paste still use the original content. Full previews, editing, dragging, and online link previews are unavailable while the content is hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备注仍会显示。复制、粘贴使用原内容；隐藏时禁用完整预览、编辑、拖拽及在线链接预览。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La note reste visible. La copie et le collage utilisent toujours le contenu original. Tant que le contenu est masqué, l’aperçu complet, la modification, le glisser-déposer et les aperçus de liens sont désactivés."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Notiz bleibt sichtbar. Beim Kopieren und Einfügen wird der Originalinhalt verwendet. Solange er verborgen ist, sind vollständige Vorschau, Bearbeitung, Ziehen und Linkvorschau gesperrt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nota resta visibile. Copia e incolla usano ancora il contenuto originale. Finché il contenuto è nascosto, l’anteprima completa, la modifica, il trascinamento e le anteprime dei link non sono disponibili."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備註仍會顯示，拷貝與貼上仍使用原始內容。隱藏時無法完整預覽、編輯、拖移或線上預覽連結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the pinned-items shortcut or menu item. In the clipboard panel it selects Pinned; a separate window only shows pinned items.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open pinned items from the menu or with their shortcut. The clipboard panel switches to the Pinned filter. The separate window shows pinned items only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用置顶专用快捷键或菜单入口。聚合模式会自动筛选置顶；单窗口只显示置顶项目。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez les éléments épinglés depuis le menu ou avec leur raccourci. Le panneau passe au filtre « Épinglés ». La fenêtre séparée affiche uniquement les éléments épinglés."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne angeheftete Einträge per Kurzbefehl oder über das Menü. Das Zwischenablagefenster wählt den Filter „Angeheftet“. Das separate Fenster zeigt nur angeheftete Einträge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri gli elementi fissati dal menu o con la loro abbreviazione. Nel pannello degli appunti viene selezionato il filtro «Fissati». La finestra separata mostra solo gli elementi fissati."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用置頂項目的快速鍵或選單項目。剪貼板面板會切換到「置頂」，獨立視窗則只顯示置頂項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
