            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示隱藏的卡片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide selected types or Handoff cards created before the selected time. Click to choose filters and a time. Click again to show hidden cards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose which card types or Handoff items to hide before a given time. Click to pick filters and a time. Click again to show the hidden cards."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏所选时间之前创建的指定类型或接力卡片。单击选择筛选条件和时间，再次单击可取消隐藏。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez les types de cartes ou les éléments Handoff à masquer avant une date donnée. Cliquez pour choisir les filtres et la date, puis cliquez de nouveau pour afficher les cartes masquées."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle Typen oder Handoff-Einträge aus, die vor einem bestimmten Zeitpunkt ausgeblendet werden sollen. Klicke, um Filter und Zeitpunkt festzulegen. Klicke erneut, um ausgeblendete Karten zu sehen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli quali tipi o elementi Handoff nascondere prima di una certa data e ora. Fai clic per scegliere filtri e orario. Fai clic di nuovo per mostrare le schede nascoste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隱藏所選時間之前建立且符合類型或接力來源的卡片。按一下選擇篩選條件和時間，再按一下即可顯示隱藏的卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is a clipboard history app based on %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
